PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility I): +10% movement speed and slight dodge chance.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility II): +20% movement speed and improved dodge chance.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility III): +30% movement speed and agile dodge chance.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility IV): +40% movement speed and high dodge chance.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Agility V): +50% movement speed (permanent quickness) and peak dodge chance.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Strength I): Avoids grappling and mild permanent life recovery.,
PropertyDescription,Ebb & Flow (Strength II): Avoids grappling and steady permanent life recovery.,
PropertyDescription,"Ebb & Flow (Strength III): Immune to slowness, avoids grappling, and improved permanent life recovery.",
PropertyDescription,"Ebb & Flow (Strength IV): Immune to slowness, avoids grappling, and strong permanent life recovery.",
