SpellDescription,"Assume the form of a targeted creature, copying its body, attributes, skills, and spells.",
SpellDescription,"Crush foes with a heavy torrent of water focused on strength, dealing light damage while reliably knocking them back and stunning them.",
SpellDescription,"Dissolve into a surging wave, blinking forward, splashing water damage around you, and briefly gaining phasing and displacement.",
SpellDescription,Release your morphed form and immediately return to your true waterkin body.,
SpellDescription,"Shift toward agility (converting 1 to 5 STR & CON into DEX per cast by mastery), freely repeatable and empowering permanent Ebb speed and dodge.",
SpellDescription,"Shift toward strength (converting 1 to 5 DEX into STR & CON per cast by mastery), freely repeatable while empowering permanent Flow slow resistance and life recovery and healing immediately.",
